# BELOTE ONLINE: Full Build Prompt for an AI Coding Assistant

> **How to use:** Paste this whole file into your AI coding assistant (Copilot, Claude, ChatGPT, Cursor, etc.) and say: *"Build exactly what this document describes. Output every file in full."*
> Everything below is a requirement unless it is marked **OPTIONAL**.

