## 2. TECH STACK (EXACT)

| Layer | Requirement |
|---|---|
| Runtime | Node.js 20 LTS (18+ must also work) |
| Server | **Node.js + Express 4** serving the static front end and a tiny JSON API |
| Realtime | **Socket.IO 4.x** (server and client). Use the `websocket` transport first, `polling` as a fallback |
| Front end | Plain HTML + ES modules (no framework). Served from `/public` |
| CSS | **Tailwind CSS exactly `3.4.17`** and **daisyUI exactly `4.12.24`**, pinned with no `^` or `~` |
| CSS build | Tailwind CLI building `public/css/input.css` to `public/css/app.css`. Do **not** use the Tailwind Play CDN |
| Tests | Node's built-in `node:test` (or Jest) plus `socket.io-client` for integration tests |

`package.json` must pin: `"tailwindcss": "3.4.17"`, `"daisyui": "4.12.24"`. Scripts: `dev`, `start`, `build:css`, `watch:css`, `test`, `simulate`.

