10. At game end: **Play again** and **Exit room**.
11. Disconnect: the game **waits 1 to 2 minutes**, then a **high-intelligence autopilot** plays for the player. The player can return later and take over at the next decision.
12. WebSockets are robust: auto-reconnect, rejoin with token, versioned state, idempotent actions, ack timeouts and retries, rate limiting, no hidden-info leaks.
13. Footer on every screen with **Created by Jewel** and the **GitHub link**.
14. All tests in Section 11 pass, and the README explains how to run everything.

